<title>USA: Just For Feet holders ok raising bond debt.</title>
<headline>Just For Feet holders ok raising bond debt.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Just For Feet Inc said Monday that its shareholders had approved an increase in its authorized level of bonded indebtedness to $300 million.</p>
<p>Earlier Monday the company reported that consolidated second quarter same-store sales had risen 92.5 percent to $112.4 million from $58.4 million a year earlier.</p>
</text>
